  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Thickly slice carrot and zucchini into rounds.\n• Cut beetroot into small chunks.\n• Cut red onion into thick wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62ccc66d592db239fe00f03a/step-84ebd7ec.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with chermoula spice blend and toss to coat.\n• Spread veggies out evenly, then roast until tender, 25-30 minutes. Set aside to slightly cool. TIP: If your oven tray is getting crowded, divide the veggies between two trays. TIP: Beetroot stays firm when cooked. It's done when you can pierce it with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62ccc66d592db239fe00f03a/step-96784557.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the veggies have 5 minutes remaining, cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Meanwhile, to the slightly cooled roasted veggie tray, add mixed salad leaves and a drizzle of white wine vinegar. Gently toss to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62ccc66d592db239fe00f03a/step-a8c77888.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide roast veggie salad between bowls. Top with haloumi and slivered almonds.\n• Serve with garlic aioli. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62ccc66d592db239fe00f03a/step-a0c0888c.jpg"
    }
  ]
